### ==============================================================================
### VARIABLES
### ==============================================================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@pages = 3


### ==============================================================================
### 1. DUCKDUCKGO SCRAPER (LOCAL API)
### ==============================================================================

### [Local DDG] Multi-Page Search via GET (Scrapes 'x' pages sequentially)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=machine+learning&pages={{pages}}&region=us-en&engine=ddg&method=POST HTTP/1.1


### [Local DDG] Multi-Page Search via POST (JSON body specifying pages)
POST {{baseUrl}}/search HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "python asyncio tutorial",
  "pages": 3,
  "region": "us-en",
  "engine": "ddg",
  "method": "POST"
}


### [Local DDG] Single-Page Search via GET
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=fastapi+tutorial&pages=1&region=us-en&engine=ddg&method=POST HTTP/1.1


### ==============================================================================
### 2. BRAVE SEARCH SCRAPER (LOCAL API)
### ==============================================================================

### [Local Brave] Multi-Page Search via GET (Offset-based pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=rust+concurrency&pages={{pages}}&engine=brave HTTP/1.1


### [Local Brave] Multi-Page Search via POST (JSON body)
POST {{baseUrl}}/search HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "golang microservices architecture",
  "pages": 3,
  "engine": "brave"
}


### [Local Brave] Single-Page Search via GET
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?q=docker+containers&pages=1&engine=brave HTTP/1.1


### ==============================================================================
### 3. SERVER HEALTH & MONITORING
### ==============================================================================

### [Local API] Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health HTTP/1.1


### ==============================================================================
### 4. DIRECT SEARCH ENGINE ENDPOINTS
### ==============================================================================

### [Direct DDG] POST Request (returns HTTP 200 with Real Search Results)
POST https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/ HTTP/1.1
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/130.0.0.0 Safari/537.36
Accept: text/html,application/xhtml+xml
Accept-Language: en-US,en;q=0.9
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Sec-Fetch-Dest: document
Sec-Fetch-Mode: navigate
Sec-Fetch-Site: none
Sec-Fetch-User: ?1

q=python+programming+language&b=&kl=us-en


### [Direct DDG] GET Request (triggers HTTP 202 Bot Challenge / Anomaly Page)
GET https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=python HTTP/1.1
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/130.0.0.0 Safari/537.36
Accept: text/html,application/xhtml+xml
Accept-Language: en-US,en;q=0.9
Sec-Fetch-Dest: document
Sec-Fetch-Mode: navigate
Sec-Fetch-Site: none
Sec-Fetch-User: ?1


### [Direct Brave] GET Request (Page 1)
GET https://search.brave.com/search?q=rust+programming HTTP/1.1
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/130.0.0.0 Safari/537.36
Accept: text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8
Accept-Language: en-US,en;q=0.9
Sec-Fetch-Dest: document
Sec-Fetch-Mode: navigate
Sec-Fetch-Site: none
Sec-Fetch-User: ?1


### [Direct Brave] GET Request (Page 2 with offset=1)
GET https://search.brave.com/search?q=rust+programming&offset=1 HTTP/1.1
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/130.0.0.0 Safari/537.36
Accept: text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8
Accept-Language: en-US,en;q=0.9
Sec-Fetch-Dest: document
Sec-Fetch-Mode: navigate
Sec-Fetch-Site: none
Sec-Fetch-User: ?1
